{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0ad50b3c3b3da28149cde3f03fcf448eeabca35108f68f8cc88d66e0a51bf3f9", "ja": "無事にイベントを終えて朋花、志保、杏奈、\nそしてリーダーの務めを立派に果たした\n美奈子はお互いを称え合う。それぞれの\n強さを活かし、最高のスタートを切った\nTeam1st、バトンは次のチームへ！", "zh": "活动顺利结束后，朋花、志保、杏奈，\n以及出色完成队长职责的美奈子互相称赞。\n发挥各自的长处，迎来了最棒的开局。\n第1队，接力棒交给下一支队伍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "380518d11386bcba83f440c4486cee4babff32998e0201a9d30b3ce73d669d7c", "ja": "インストアライブ＆特典サイン＆握手会　終了後……", "zh": "店内演唱会＆特典签名＆握手会结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1001_401pro", "source_sha256": "2b2299bfa09b5d00f79b041ce798d717348fa6ff3726be7ef9fa0b2ad739dadd", "ja": "トラブルもなく、イベントは大盛況で終了、大成功だ！\nみんな、本当にお疲れさま！", "zh": "没有发生任何意外，活动在一片热烈的气氛中圆满结束，大获成功！\n大家，真的辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "d2a8f4689dca88c29c0faebc842052602c5dea2a431a235b76d50f4a3b54c7f2", "ja": "お疲れさまでした！", "zh": "辛苦大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "62c5900d6eb6f444d65eebfba1fd75258663882904ee61ffaf7f9f71659d58b6", "ja": "お疲れさまでした～。", "zh": "辛苦了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "7b4cbdcd7ae7d6ec677cb963e6e8b9dfc84c12b42da7dc009f6c1e988451cac9", "ja": "お疲れさまでした。", "zh": "辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "c2a0b19ec1446c34b524f420d097f2d294f15c9664d1916a5a567a3978099b39", "ja": "お疲れ、さま……。", "zh": "辛苦，了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "cc003d554ff4d5ca82ec0230bd95a879ba36f18a0c628c5b8bc5ea31ea10f880", "ja": "本当に大盛況だったよね！　特に朋花ちゃんの列！\nみんな、すっごく整然と並んでて♪", "zh": "真的特别热闹呢！尤其是朋花亲那队！\n大家都排得整整齐齐的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "aae6033e07c4f199b95c51f507dd85d3268286b52b0996731a7491e505027acb", "ja": "ふふっ。私の子豚ちゃんたちは、信心深くて\nいい子たちばかりですから～♪", "zh": "呵呵，我的小猪们可都虔诚得很，\n个个都是乖孩子呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "e1269fea135972745ffd4887ea95479fc81cf2dc899166ea56411e77edf863a5", "ja": "サインをすごく厳重に包んでる人も見かけました。\n本当に熱心なんですね。……その、子豚さん達。", "zh": "我还看到有人把签名包得特别严实。\n真是非常热心呢。……我是说，那些小猪们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "e42d930b2909bb7a74098ed5789e2563c691350a497c252f2fe8b4f64fffc304", "ja": "そういう志保ちゃんは、ステージでは凛々しいのに\n握手会ではリアクションが可愛いと評判でしたね～。", "zh": "志保呢，明明在舞台上英姿飒爽，据说在握手会上却因为反应可爱而广受好评呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "80ef211aed818611bde74b62db0c8877ab8b4f6c88787256412bdd106857bcd3", "ja": "あ、あれは慣れてなくて、サインをたまに失敗するのが\n面白がられてただけで……。練習します。", "zh": "啊，那只是因为我还不习惯，偶尔会把签名搞砸，大家觉得很有意思而已……我会练习的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "961c9b7a60ce7ec7a628ae4b75395c3a1c64c4870339b27d65b9ef3ddaa43db8", "ja": "杏奈ちゃんの列も賑わってたよね！\n杏奈ちゃんもお客さんも、ずーっと楽しそうで！", "zh": "杏奈那边的队伍也很热闹呢！\n杏奈和客人们看起来一直都很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "1c758c1a15cb27c6d550783325d08ac1b38d57682abecdc095ba55b626446ad6", "ja": "杏奈、がんばり、ました……。\nでも、もう……充電しないと、無理……かも……。", "zh": "杏奈，努力过了……  \n但是，已经……不充电的话，可能……撑不住了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "cad33e45f91020afd7b15c6f39296c50147e8bf718ad27ee12f723d2c130510f", "ja": "うん、たっぷり休んで♪　あ、何か食べる？\n今日はシューマイがオススメかなぁ？", "zh": "嗯，好好休息吧♪啊，要不要吃点什么？\n今天推荐烧卖哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "3b642e5acf8c74ce405c37a7096c1c0b5d4fc938379d4263a9061ec32dcfe7ae", "ja": "ううん……。美奈子さんこそ、休んで……。\n今日の、MVP……。", "zh": "不……美奈子小姐才该休息……  \n今天的MVP……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "04b23f0092f099733f1991a61619241a714113ea6bac01930fecbfacb94225c3", "ja": "SNSで、神対応って……バズってます。", "zh": "社交网络上……因为神对应爆火了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "63a0865cc8d0385a312f9413c0688964a994f809658f3d08aa334655ae983afb", "ja": "今日のようなイベントだと、美奈子さんの気遣いや\n優しさは、そのまま伝わりますからね～。", "zh": "像今天这样的活动，美奈子小姐的体贴和温柔，都能直接传达给大家呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "933188805fc77925b01d38f90e4067e96826594546ced3770dfe9829c86ce2f6", "ja": "お客さんたちだけじゃなくて、私たちのこともずっと\n見てくれていて……。頼もしかったです。", "zh": "不只是客人们，也一直关注着我们……真的很可靠。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "135a62c4416a3592ca98f96aefa08386103e16d56c08a867a68caa3d67095aec", "ja": "そ、そんな。私、特別なことなんてなにもしてないよ？\nいつも通り頑張ってただけっていうか……。", "zh": "没、没这回事。我也没做什么特别的事呀？只是像平时一样努力而已……该怎么说呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1020_401pro", "source_sha256": "5e5c3146a511e54c250fd08b6f404fb19b38261fdaeb217b25cbdabb272cdd52", "ja": "いつも特別に頑張ってくれてるんだろうな。\nだからみんな、安心できるんだと思う。", "zh": "你一直都在特别努力吧。\n所以大家才能安心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "6433d604387a3fe4c5f9aa90519b628db2a41265411b3677913fcae0d6b56938", "ja": "プロデューサーさん……。", "zh": "制作人……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1022_401pro", "source_sha256": "8d74e1435b77d9095102013c8d5966dcb40f534d98d87bb1b4fc1a226e302912", "ja": "おかげでTeam1stは、一番手として\n最高のスタートを切れた。", "zh": "多亏了你，Team1st作为第一组，迎来了最棒的开局。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1023_401pro", "source_sha256": "b404d59c4f5a31f7ab8397e53251b31ae612c5b6054e5e68153f788ed8ba9f08", "ja": "もちろん美奈子だけじゃなくて。朋花も、志保も、\n杏奈も……。みんな改めて、本当にありがとう！", "zh": "当然不止是美奈子。朋花也是，志保也是，\n还有杏奈……真的要再次向大家道一声谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "eed03966bba2bc6e44d7de65643165e1c9bf05b6688b66fa0c16ce5614d4c434", "ja": "あ……。えっと……。", "zh": "啊……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "d72ea421aef71bf8c90c5e896dc6e95e9b1dd2de8658f316b4aa3aa862d49b4d", "ja": "はあああああああぁぁぁぁぁぁぁぁ～～～～～～……。", "zh": "哈啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊～～～～～～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "85f0964786452e25dd4ae7e45294e57ed9d6ea4de8145e56667447d1079eff9c", "ja": "み、美奈子さん！？\n大丈夫ですか……？", "zh": "美、美奈子小姐！？  \n您没事吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1027_019min", "source_sha256": "fb5adde6ae9608ec35d091b0234a86e3a56aca68b0bb4b610241c03b933b0714", "ja": "えへへ、大丈夫。なんだか……\nちゃんとできたんだって、やっと……思えたみたい……", "zh": "嘿嘿，没事。不知怎么的……\n我好像终于……觉得自己真的做好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1028_401pro", "source_sha256": "79ab4201d2adbc0e60b5095fd6a748024202b3d6e61128077b807508217be75f", "ja": "……バッチリだったよ。ひとまず肩の荷をおろして、\nゆっくり休んでくれ。", "zh": "……表现得非常完美哦。先卸下肩上的重担，\n好好休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1029_401pro", "source_sha256": "33640a1f4e271208b6009bdaf4e5afc6eb3603ccef701bc24b5867c896875d3f", "ja": "みんなのバトンは、\n次のチームがしっかり受け取ってくれてるから！", "zh": "大家的接力棒，\n下一支队伍已经好好接过去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1030_024ann", "source_sha256": "8b4403b7e49bf93814336581b4d67b7270e7f0ad8096c12932a134a633b0fe2b", "ja": "次の、チーム……。", "zh": "下一个……团队……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_05_1031_031tom", "source_sha256": "f1dab3cef5d791940a0755ab64a4d3f12db1febc4db59cd8c6db82127bd4704e", "ja": "どんなデビューになるのか楽しみですね～♪\n詳細はもう決まっているんですか～？", "zh": "会以什么样的形式出道呢，真让人期待呀～♪\n详细安排已经决定好了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
